 "playtime_at_review": 3753, "last_played": 1785691297, "avatar": "8df051aa1e3ee396944b59039a2764f6c41bffbf"}, "language": "english", "review": "A great game, balanced game-play and a perfect story.\nPricing is good too. \nShould try it out.", "timestamp_created": 1698777487, "timestamp_updated": 1700850975, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 27, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.618360519409179688", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "149259423", "author": {"steamid": "76561198002964053", "personaname": "JohnTheCrow", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/johnthecrow/", "num_games_owned": 1052, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 1022, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 887, "last_played": 1730688490, "avatar": "2e63e81c72b0e3522fa418c8d007fc09a4ca4904"}, "language": "english", "review": "Dark Souls with guns 2. The multiplayer is a little wonky because you can be teamed up with anyone around the globe, so I often get paired up with a person with Chinese characters in their name and my ping turns to ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ and it becomes impossible to dodge. This is a really fun game though, basically the same as the first one with slightly better graphics and way more gear. The game strikes a good balance between holding your hand and letting you explore by telling you which zone you're supposed to be in but not explicitly pointing you in correct direction 100% of the time. Some of the puzzles fall flat but I just don't care for overly convoluted puzzles, so that's just me. It is fun to shoot bad guys.", "timestamp_created": 1698768272, "timestamp_updated": 1698768272, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "r